SUMMARY:Intro/Welcome
LOCATION:Small Theatre\, Prague Congress Centre
DESCRIPTION:Device and Specific Purpose Memory MC · https://lpc.events/eve
 nt/20/contributions/2628/
URL:https://lpc.events/event/20/contributions/2628/
